            "review_title": "Review at Sui Cao Dai Nuong",
            "review_text": "Shane-Greazely\nHong Kong26 contributions\n0\nQuick Lunch Time Snack: Not too bad!\nDec 2017 • Couples\nMy wife and I were were in the neighbourhood checking out the Binh Tay Market area, the St Xavier Parish and the Thien Hau Temple. \n\nI didn't see anything about it in the English guide books but it's included in the Japanese guidebooks. \n\nWe just had the pan fried dumplings(Cao Chien) and a beer. Very delicious and I would easily recommend stopping by for the same.\nRead more\nWritten December 18, 2017",
